From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 03:40:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08599/11362] Phase 2a: expanded-roster think A/B gate NOT MET
 (REQ-ARC-WMTE-6242)

16-game de-confounded think-vs-no_think admission-rate A/B, pre-registered
sign test on heldout_accuracy>=1.0. Result: 1 favor think (sp80), 0 favor
no_think, 12 tie (11 at accuracy floor). p=1.0, gate needs >=6 discordant
at p<0.05. Phase 2b does not unlock.

Bonus: cross-run comparison against the pre-confound-fix exp6199 artifact
shows vc33's think arm dropped from heldout_accuracy=1.0 to 0.0 once this
session's own no_think confound fix landed -- direct confirmation the old
apparent think-advantage was partly an artifact of the leaked env var, not
a real effect. sp80 replicates as a genuine win across both runs.

Survived 2 llama-server reaper recurrences + 1 external-timeout cutoff
across 4 launch attempts; per-(game,arm) checkpointing recovered cleanly
each time with zero data loss.
